    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s SPA2929 drawing. Grey bevel shading was separated from the coloured faces, and the 6 pt band centre lines snapped to exact values. The unit-star opening is shared with the earlier reconstructions. Three square-diagonal transfers from B give the cell; the lines through M complete the bands. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
